====== AsiaRF AWM-EVB, AWM002, AWM003 ======

This is not a router product, but a router module designed by [[http://www.asiarf.com|AsiaRF]]. ARM002 is a low-cost embedded UART-ETH-WIFI module (serial port - Ethernet - Wireless network).
This product is an embedded module with USB, built-in TCP/IP protocol stack, serial port, Ethernet, wireless network (wifi) interface, I2S/PCM, JTAG, I2C.

This module is very small - 25mm x 35mm

